7002=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\frac{| a-b-300 |}{\sqrt{2}}\cdot DE
=\frac{1}{2}\cdot\frac{| a\pm 18-300 |}{\sqrt{2}}\cdot 9\sqrt{2}.
\]Thus $a=\pm 18 \pm 1556 + 300$, and the sum of the four possible values of $a$ is $4\cdot300=\boxed{1200}$.

