\[
\mathbf{q}
=\mathrm{proj}_{\mathbf{d}}(\mathbf{u})
=\frac{\mathbf{u}\cdot\mathbf{d}}{\mathbf{d}\cdot\mathbf{d}}\;\mathbf{d}
=\frac{(0)(1)+(4)(3)}{1^2+3^2}\,\mathbf{d}
=\frac{12}{10}\begin{pmatrix}1\\3\end{pmatrix}
=\begin{pmatrix}6/5\\18/5\end{pmatrix}.
\]
Because $\mathbf{q}$ is the midpoint of $\mathbf{u}$ and its reflection $\mathbf{r}$, we have
\[
\mathbf{q}=\frac{\mathbf{u}+\mathbf{r}}{2}
\quad\Longrightarrow\quad
\mathbf{r}=2\mathbf{q}-\mathbf{u}
=2\begin{pmatrix}6/5\\18/5\end{pmatrix}-\begin{pmatrix}0\\4\end{pmatrix}
=\begin{pmatrix}12/5\\16/5\end{pmatrix}.
\]
